"CFBundleDisplayName" = "Hale 息";
"NSHealthShareUsageDescription" = "Hale 息 reads the Health data you allow (such as heart rate, HRV and beat-to-beat intervals, ECGs, sleep, workouts, steps and energy) to calculate your recovery, sleep and strain, and syncs it to your account on the Hale 息 server. It is never used for advertising or sold. An AI reads it only when you use Jarvis.";
"NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription" = "Hale 息 does not write your data to Health. Only developer test builds add sample data in the simulator.";
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Used to scan your setup QR code and, when you choose to, to take a photo for Jarvis or for your profile picture. Photos go to your account on the Hale 息 server, and to your AI only when you send them to Jarvis.";
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "Used only while you hold the mic button to talk to Jarvis. Your voice is turned into text on this iPhone or on the Hale 息 server; no recording is kept.";
"NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription" = "Used only while you talk to Jarvis: Apple's on-device recognition turns what you say into text on this iPhone.";
